---
import PageHeader from "@/components/PageHeader.astro";
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - TechSquidTV"
  description="Learn how TechSquidTV handles newsletter information and anonymous site analytics."
>
  <PageHeader title="Privacy Policy">
    <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">Last Updated: August 27, 2026</p>
  </PageHeader>

  <div class="text-text-secondary space-y-8 leading-relaxed">
    <p>
      Welcome to techsquidtv.com. This policy explains how information is
      handled when you visit this site. The goal is to collect as little data as
      possible while keeping the site running smoothly and sending updates to
      people who ask for them.
    </p>

    <section aria-labelledby="newsletter">
      <h2 id="newsletter" class="text-text-primary mb-3 text-2xl font-semibold">
        1. The Newsletter (Email Collection)
      </h2>
      <p>
        The only personal information collected on this site is your email
        address, and only if you choose to subscribe to the newsletter. You may
        also provide your name; this optional field is used only to personalize
        newsletter communications.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
        <li>
          <strong class="text-text-primary">Purpose:</strong> Your email address is
          used exclusively to notify you when new posts or content are published.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-text-primary">Protection:</strong> Your email address
          will never be sold, traded, rented, or shared with external marketing agencies.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-text-primary">Your control:</strong> You can opt out
          at any time by using the unsubscribe link at the bottom of a newsletter
          email. Doing so removes your address from the active mailing list.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="analytics">
      <h2 id="analytics" class="text-text-primary mb-3 text-2xl font-semibold">
        2. Anonymous Site Analytics
      </h2>
      <p>
        To understand which content is helpful and to keep the site working
        correctly, techsquidtv.com uses Sentry for site analytics and error
        monitoring.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
        <li>
          <strong class="text-text-primary">What is tracked:</strong> Sentry tracks
          anonymous behavioral metrics, such as page views, scroll depth, button clicks,
          and technical errors such as broken links or page crashes.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-text-primary">Anonymity:</strong> This data is anonymous
          and aggregated. No IP addresses, device fingerprints, or cross-site tracking
          cookies are stored, and behavioral data is not linked to your identity or
          email address.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="processors">
      <h2 id="processors" class="text-text-primary mb-3 text-2xl font-semibold">
        3. Third-Party Processors
      </h2>
      <p>
        To provide the newsletter and analytics, this site relies on trusted
        third-party services:
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
        <li>
          <strong class="text-text-primary">Resend</strong> securely manages the email
          subscriber list and sends newsletter emails.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-text-primary">Sentry</strong> processes anonymous analytics
          and performance data.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-4">
        These services act as data processors on behalf of TechSquidTV and
        handle this limited information under their own privacy and security
        policies.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="contact">
      <h2 id="contact" class="text-text-primary mb-3 text-2xl font-semibold">
        4. Contact
      </h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions, concerns, or requests about this privacy policy
        or your data, contact Kyle Tryon at
        <a href="mailto:kyle@techsquidtv.com">kyle@techsquidtv.com</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
